      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Best you can do in this situation is buy a cheap vr solution. for my first 3 months or so i used Nolo VR which uses a mobile phone (i used a Galaxy 8) and it has a head tracker, 2 controllers and a single base station. That paired with Trinus worked wonders after it was set up.",
