      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is something you can already do via the RiftCat desktop app paired with the VRidge mobile app OR the TrinusVR app. If you want arms, you'll have to get a PS camera and move controllers. It's a hassle, though, so I'd recommend purchasing a mixed reality headset if you can't afford an Oculus or Vive. I got mine for $160 on Amazon. It's pretty much the same experience, but it's cheaper.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
